{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"远足代数"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"远足代数"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>远足代数是 "},{"Local":{"url":"VLafforgueExc","text":"Vincent Lafforgue"}},{"Plain":" 定义的一个"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":", 作用在尖点自守形式空间上, 而其"},{"Local":{"url":"谱(代数)","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"实现了 Langlands 参数的空间, 从而通过"},{"Local":{"url":"谱分解","text":"谱分解"}},{"Plain":"将自守形式的空间分解为 Langlands 参数标记的分量, 给出 “自守到 Galois” 的对应.</p>\n<p>相关笔记: "},{"Local":{"url":"Chtoucas","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<hr />\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"GaitsgoryLinReevesExcALg","text":"Gaitsgory–Lin–Reeves"}},{"Plain":" 抽象了这一代数, 将其定义为某种局部系统模空间上的函数环.</p>\n<p>相关笔记: "},{"Local":{"url":"Excursion","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}